# Normalise line endings across devices (Linux server = LF, Windows laptop, phone).
# Without this, Windows git (core.autocrlf=true) rewrites every server-authored
# file as CRLF, making immutable 00-Raw sources show as spuriously "modified".
# Force LF in the repo and on checkout everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Markdown and the vault's text formats are always LF.
*.md   text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.py   text eol=lf
*.sh   text eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touch.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.m4a  binary
*.wav  binary
*.mp3  binary
